These extensions are used for testing the content script restrictions that apply
to login screen extensions.

Extension IDs:
Extension with a good content script: "jpbinmmnncmfffhfpeonjmcgnapcholg"
Extension with a bad content script: "edehlkcoilmenhomhdakcpolbbimkhlg"
